ET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_JannathFriendAskingNews</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_JannathFriendAskingNews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_JannathFriendAskingNews\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f7161156-264a-484c-92dd-fe8d9a88e5bf</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f7161156-264a-484c-92dd-fe8d9a88e5bf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f7161156-264a-484c-92dd-fe8d9a88e5bf\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-253&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-78</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dearest Fi-Fi,\n</p><p><br>\nI write hoping you've received word from <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar</a> at last, or made any headway at all as to his whereabouts? I've known you for too long to believe you're not tossing and turning at night over his absence. You must be worried <i>sick</i>.\n</p><p><br>\nDo let me know as soon as you hear anything. I promise I'll keep any news - good or ill - in the <i>strictest</i> confidence. We both know how the nobility ove to gossip.\n</p><p><br>\nWith love and concern,\n</p><p>Maria\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1365/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25089/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6753/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937801/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.950      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.950      1 -total\n 50.87%   20.832      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.88%   18.787     15 Template:Trim\n 25.76%   10.551      2 Template:Uid\n 15.63%    6.400      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.70%    5.611      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.73%    3.984      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.56%    3.916      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.55%    3.910      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35193-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202528 and revision id 377861. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}